From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Creeeeger <104427569+Creeeeger@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Pin the compatible Keystore release

Galaxy Store updates replace the system APK and remove the SSP
compatibility patch. Reserve the highest signed version code for the ROM
build while preserving the Samsung release name and internal version.
Deliver future compatible Keystore releases through ROM updates.

Signed-off-by: Creeeeger <104427569+Creeeeger@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/apktool.yml b/apktool.yml
--- a/apktool.yml
+++ b/apktool.yml
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@
 packageInfo:
   forcedPackageId: 127
 versionInfo:
-  versionCode: 131902000
+  versionCode: 2147483647
   versionName: 1.3.19.2
 doNotCompress:
 - arsc
